{"SAFE_MOMENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"It's so quiet I can hear the bugs again","Let's just sit for a minute - please","Nothing, nothing at all, I almost forgot what nothing sounds like","I'm going to sit here and not think for ten whole seconds, watch me","Listen, hear that? That's the sound of nobody trying to kill us","For one minute, just one, let's pretend everything is fine","The dust's settling, finally, let it settle, let it settle","I could sleep for a week, I could sleep for ten years","It's peaceful, and I can't remember the last time that was true","Just sit with me and enjoy this","Can we stay like this a little longer?","Is this what peace feels like? I forgot, honestly","Quiet right now, nice and quiet, let's not ruin it","I can hear my own heartbeat, that's how quiet it is","Just breathe, everybody, nobody's chasing us right now","Moments like this, I almost forget what's out there... almost","Nothing's biting, nothing's chasing, I might actually be able to eat"}},
