{"SAFE_MOMENT","role=rescue_clergy",{"Lord, thank you for this quiet, thank you for this moment","Our Father, who art in heaven, hallowed be thy name, thy kingdom come-","Please keep them safe, please keep them all safe, Lord, I'm begging","Hear my prayer, hear it, please, we are so tired","Amen... thank you, Lord, amen","I pray for them, even the ones out there, even them","Psalm twenty-three, the Lord is my shepherd, I shall not want-","Bless this little place, bless these good people","Praying for you, praying for the whole world, why not","Dear God, if you're listening, we could use some help down here","Hail Mary, full of grace, the Lord is with thee-","Be still, my soul, be still, that's the one I like"}},
